            "review_title": "Review at Baieta Saigon",
            "review_text": "Heidi Christine O\nOslo, Norway202 contributions\n1\nFantastic view, good service and amazing food\nMar 2025 • Couples\nWe found this great place on a walk on the riverwalk. Reserved a table for dinner. The food was amazing. The burger was extremely tasty and tje grilled seabass was relly good, with the best ratoulle and mashed potatoes. Recommend also long island ice tea.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 6, 2025",
